<title>SPAIN: Spain's CNMV approves Ducde takeover of Bilbaina.</title>
<headline>Spain's CNMV approves Ducde takeover of Bilbaina.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's stock market commission CNMV said on Monday it had approved a takeover bid by sparkling wine producer Ducde SA for 100 percent of the shares of winemaker Bodegas Bilbainas SA.</p>
<p>Ducde is a unit of Cava sparkling wine producers Codorniu.</p>
<p>Ducde said it was bidding for 100 percent of the shares at a per share price of 6,000 pesetas on condition it acquired at least 51 percent of the shares.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2160</p>
</text>
